            %p
          .proof
            %h6 Proof
            %p
              The left Quillen property of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi f
                      %mo *
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f^\ast
              is HSS20, Lem. 7.22](#HebestreitSagaveSchlichtkrull20). The right Quillen property is mentioned inside the proof of Lem. 8.10 there.
          %p Similarly, but now also for the positive local model structure, we have:
          %p
