          %h2#references References
          %h3#tools Tools
          %p
            Tools for creating
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structures+on+spectra"} model structures on spectra
            relative to suitable ambient model categories:
          %ul
            %li#Schwede97
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Schwede"}> Stefan Schwede
              , Section 3 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Spectra in model categories and applications to the algebraic cotangent complex
              %strong 120
              (1997) 104 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://www.math.uni-bonn.de/people/schwede/modelspec.pdf"}> pdf
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            and also for
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structures+on+symmetric+spectra"} model structures on symmetric spectra
          %ul
            %li#Hovey00
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+Hovey"}> Mark Hovey
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Spectra and symmetric spectra in general model categories
              %strong 165
              1 (2001) 63-127 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0004051"}> arXiv:0004051
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-4049(00)00172-9"} doi:10.1016/S0022-4049(00)00172-9
          %h3#over_a_fixed_base Over a fixed base
          %p
            Model structure for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/genuine+equivariant+spectra"} genuine equivariant spectra
            parameterized over a fixed base:
          %ul
            %li#MaySigurdsson06
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+May"}> Peter May
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Johann+Sigurdsson"} Johann Sigurdsson
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Parametrized+Homotopy+Theory"} Parametrized Homotopy Theory
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 132
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0411656"} arXiv:math/0411656
          %h3#ReferencesOverVaryingBases Over varying bases
          %p Model structures of parameterized spectra over varying bases:
          %ul
            %li#BraunackMayer19
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vincent+Braunack-Mayer"}> Vincent Braunack-Mayer
